Q[50266]={d="Depois da ruptura de Draenor, quase toda a vida foi destruída quando a barreira entre Draenor e a Espiral Etérea colapsou, causando a explosão que se seguiu. A fauna que sobreviveu adoeceu ou foi corrompida, e muitos dos portais de Ner'zhul permaneceram abertos, permitindo que todo tipo de criatura perigosa entrasse em Terralém e ameaçasse nossa presença aqui. A população de Javalis Vis está se tornando uma ameaça real. Viaje até o Vale da Lua Negra e abata 30 deles.",dEN="After the sundering of Draenor, most life was wiped out during collapse of the barrier between Draenor and the Twisting Nether and the resulting explosion. The wildlife that survived became sickly or corrupt, and many of Ner'zhul's portals were left permanently open, allowing all manner of dangerous beings to enter Outland and threaten our presence here. The Felboar population is becoming a real threat. Travel to Shadowmoon Valley and cull 30 of them.",o="Jornada ao Vale Sombrauna e errázate 30 Javalinas Vil.",oEN="Travel to Shadowmoon Valley and cull 30 Felboars."}
Q[50267]={d="Após a cisão de Draenor, grande parte da vida foi exterminada com o colapso da barreira entre Draenor e a Espiral Etérea e a explosão resultante. A fauna que sobreviveu adoeceu ou foi corrompida, e muitos dos portais de Ner'zhul permaneceram abertos, permitindo que todo tipo de criatura perigosa entrasse em Terralém e ameaçasse nossa presença aqui.\n\nA população de Quimera de Asa Vil está se tornando uma ameaça real. Viaje até Vale da Lua Negra e elimine 5 deles.",dEN="After the sundering of Draenor, most life was wiped out during collapse of the barrier between Draenor and the Twisting Nether and the resulting explosion. The wildlife that survived became sickly or corrupt, and many of Ner'zhul's portals were left permanently open, allowing all manner of dangerous beings to enter Outland and threaten our presence here. The Vilewing Chimaera population is becoming a real threat. Travel to Shadowmoon Valley and cull 5 of them.",o="Jornada ao Vale Sombrauna e errázate 5 Chimaeras Alaenveneno.",oEN="Travel to Shadowmoon Valley and cull 5 Vilewing Chimaeras."}
Q[50268]={d="Após a cisão de Draenor, grande parte da vida foi exterminada com o colapso da barreira entre Draenor e a Espiral Etérea e a explosão resultante. A fauna que sobreviveu adoeceu ou foi corrompida, e muitos dos portais de Ner'zhul permaneceram abertos, permitindo que todo tipo de criatura perigosa entrasse em Terralém e ameaçasse nossa presença aqui.\n\nA população de Arraia Etérea está se tornando uma ameaça real. Viaje até Vale da Lua Negra e elimine 30 deles.",dEN="After the sundering of Draenor, most life was wiped out during collapse of the barrier between Draenor and the Twisting Nether and the resulting explosion. The wildlife that survived became sickly or corrupt, and many of Ner'zhul's portals were left permanently open, allowing all manner of dangerous beings to enter Outland and threaten our presence here. The Netherskate population is becoming a real threat. Travel to Shadowmoon Valley and cull 30 of them.",o="Viaje para a Bacia Sombra Lua e errázate 30 Netherskates.",oEN="Travel to Shadowmoon Valley and cull 30 Netherskates."}
Q[50269]={d="Após a cisão de Draenor, grande parte da vida foi exterminada com o colapso da barreira entre Draenor e a Espiral Etérea e a explosão resultante. A fauna que sobreviveu adoeceu ou foi corrompida, e muitos dos portais de Ner'zhul permaneceram abertos, permitindo que todo tipo de criatura perigosa entrasse em Terralém e ameaçasse nossa presença aqui.\n\nA população de Protetor Guarda-Terror está se tornando uma ameaça real. Viaje até Base Forjadora: Oblívio e elimine 30 deles.",dEN="After the sundering of Draenor, most life was wiped out during collapse of the barrier between Draenor and the Twisting Nether and the resulting explosion. The wildlife that survived became sickly or corrupt, and many of Ner'zhul's portals were left permanently open, allowing all manner of dangerous beings to enter Outland and threaten our presence here. The Terrorguard Protector population is becoming a real threat. Travel to Forge Base: Oblivion and cull 30 of them.",o="Viagem a Forge Base: Oblivion e errázate 30 Terrorguard Protectors.",oEN="Travel to Forge Base: Oblivion and cull 30 Terrorguard Protectors."}
Q[50270]={d=false,dEN="After the sundering of Draenor, most life was wiped out during collapse of the barrier between Draenor and the Twisting Nether and the resulting explosion. The wildlife that survived became sickly or corrupt, and many of Ner'zhul's portals were left permanently open, allowing all manner of dangerous beings to enter Outland and threaten our presence here. The Cavern Crawler population is becoming a real threat. Travel to Blades' Run and cull 30 of them.",o="Viagem a Blades' Run e errázate 30 Cavern Crawlers.",oEN="Travel to Blades' Run and cull 30 Cavern Crawlers."}
Q[50271]={d=false,dEN="After the sundering of Draenor, most life was wiped out during collapse of the barrier between Draenor and the Twisting Nether and the resulting explosion. The wildlife that survived became sickly or corrupt, and many of Ner'zhul's portals were left permanently open, allowing all manner of dangerous beings to enter Outland and threaten our presence here. The Vengeful Husk population is becoming a real threat. Travel to Derelict Caravan and cull 12 of them.",o="Jornada ao Caravana Abandonada e errázate 12 Vengeful Husks.",oEN="Travel to Derelict Caravan and cull 12 Vengeful Husks."}
Q[50272]={d=false,dEN="After the sundering of Draenor, most life was wiped out during collapse of the barrier between Draenor and the Twisting Nether and the resulting explosion. The wildlife that survived became sickly or corrupt, and many of Ner'zhul's portals were left permanently open, allowing all manner of dangerous beings to enter Outland and threaten our presence here. The Daggermaw Blackhide population is becoming a real threat. Travel to Bloodmaul Ravine and cull 9 of them.",o="Viaje para a Fendido de Sangramuela e errázate 9 Pellejolobos Cuchillazos.",oEN="Travel to Bloodmaul Ravine and cull 9 Daggermaw Blackhides."}
Q[50273]={d="Após a cisão de Draenor, grande parte da vida foi exterminada com o colapso da barreira entre Draenor e a Espiral Etérea e a explosão resultante. A fauna que sobreviveu adoeceu ou foi corrompida, e muitos dos portais de Ner'zhul permaneceram abertos, permitindo que todo tipo de criatura perigosa entrasse em Terralém e ameaçasse nossa presença aqui.\n\nA população de Caminhante-raiz Infestado está se tornando uma ameaça real. Viaje até Ermos de Ossos e elimine 30 deles.",dEN="After the sundering of Draenor, most life was wiped out during collapse of the barrier between Draenor and the Twisting Nether and the resulting explosion. The wildlife that survived became sickly or corrupt, and many of Ner'zhul's portals were left permanently open, allowing all manner of dangerous beings to enter Outland and threaten our presence here. The Infested Root-Walker population is becoming a real threat. Travel to The Bone Wastes and cull 30 of them.",o="Viaje para Os Estercoleros e errázate 30 Caminorredondas Infestados.",oEN="Travel to The Bone Wastes and cull 30 Infested Root-Walkers."}
Q[50274]={d=false,dEN="After the sundering of Draenor, most life was wiped out during collapse of the barrier between Draenor and the Twisting Nether and the resulting explosion. The wildlife that survived became sickly or corrupt, and many of Ner'zhul's portals were left permanently open, allowing all manner of dangerous beings to enter Outland and threaten our presence here. The Scorpid Bonecrawler population is becoming a real threat. Travel to The Bone Wastes and cull 30 of them.",o="Viaje para A Portão da Morte e errázate 30 Escorpídeos Osseradores.",oEN="Travel to Death's Door and cull 30 Scorpid Bonecrawlers."}
