Q[175326]={d=false,dEN="Ah, it is rare to see new faces in Dunshire these days.\\n\\nI suppose you are something of a... mercenary?\\n\\nGood, good. I have money to spare, and work that needs doing.\\n\\nWith trade disrupted, the kingdom has neglected the roads, and the wolves have grown bold. It is only a matter of time before they reach Dunshire.\\n\\nKill a few south of here. Remind them to fear steel and flame.",o="Mate os lobos que rondam Dunshire, ao pé do penhasco.",oEN="Slay the wolves prowling around Dunshire, at the foot of the cliff."}
