Q[208801]={d="Os muros de Ahn'Qiraj estremecem. Um poder maligno, mais antigo que o próprio mundo, foi destruído.\\n\\nA visão dos vestígios da aberração colossal quase lhe congela o coração. Mesmo morto, o legado maligno de C'Thun continua presente no ar.\\n\\nVocê fez o que julgavam impossível.\\n\\nVocê recolhe um pedúnculo do demônio, alojando-o na mochila.\\n\\nLeve o Olho de C'Thun aos dragões no aposento seguinte.",dEN="The walls of Ahn'Qiraj tremble. A force of evil, older than the world itself, has been destroyed.\\n\\nAs you look at the remnants of the colossal abomination your heart nearly freezes. Even in death you can feel the legacy of C'Thun's evil around you.\\n\\nYou have done what was thought to be impossible.\\n\\nYou grab at an eye stalk of the fiend, stowing it safely in your pack.\\n\\nTake the Eye of C'Thun to the dragons in the next chamber.",o="Leve o Olho de C'Thun para Celestrasz no Templo de Ahn'Qiraj.",oEN="Take the Eye of C'Thun to Caelastrasz in the Temple of Ahn'Qiraj.",p="<Caelastrasz se ajoelha diante de você.>\n\n$n, você nos libertou do controle dele.",pEN="Lady <name>, you have freed us of its grasp.",c="Nos marcharemos deste lugar por nossa conta, Senhora $n - uma vez estemos seguros do que ele mal o que tem dentro tem sido totalmente destruído. Sua jornada mutuamente esta a ponto de terminar.",cEN="We will leave this place on our own, Lady <name> - once we are certain that the evil within has been wholly destroyed. Your journey of legend is almost at an end."}
Q[208802]={d="Siga rumo às Cavernas do Tempo, $gmeu senhor:minha senhora;. Anacronos aguarda seu retorno. Entregue-lhe o olho de C'Thun, pois que, de certo, ele desejará agregá-lo à coleção do seu amo.",dEN="The lifeless eye of the ancient god still penetrates your mind with its malicious stare. Anachronos at the Caverns of Time should take care of this. Give him the eye of C'Thun as he will undoubtedly wish to place it in his master's collection.",o="Leve o Olho de C'Thun para Anacronos nas Cavernas do Tempo.",oEN="Take the Eye of C'Thun to Anachronos at the Caverns of Time.",p="Lorde $n! Acabou...",pEN="Lord <name>! It is over...",c=false,cEN="The Master has left these for you, champion. From the timeless cache: A collection of artifacts spanning thousands of years - the choice is yours."}
Q[209103]={d=false,dEN="I make no pretenses, maggot. The darkness Plagueheart items hold could very well destroy the both of us. That is why the price is so high. If I'm going to die, it's going to be as a rich man.\\n\\nAnd I don't give an ounce of gnoll spit how you die, only that you do as I ask. Bring me what I require and we will both benefit - or die; but I've already explained this...",o="Mataus, o Arauto da Ira, na Capela Esperança da Luz, que fica nas Terras Pestilentas Orientais, fará para você uma Veste do Coração Pestilento se você levar para ele: 1 Veste Profanada, 25 Restos de Tecido, 4 pedaços de Lunatrama e 2 Cristais do Nexus.",oEN="Mataus the Wrathcaster at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make a Plagueheart Robe if you bring him the following: 1 Desecrated Robe, 25 Wartorn Cloth Scraps, 4 Mooncloth and 2 Nexus Crystals.",c="Excelente, $n! Você trouxe tudo o que pedi. Agora posso confeccionar Veste de Coração Pestilento.",cEN="Exellent <name>!\\n, you got everything just as i asked and now i can make a Plagueheart Robe."}
Q[209104]={d=false,dEN="I make no pretenses, maggot. The darkness Plagueheart items hold could very well destroy the both of us. That is why the price is so high. If I'm going to die, it's going to be as a rich man.\\n\\nAnd I don't give an ounce of gnoll spit how you die, only that you do as I ask. Bring me what I require and we will both benefit - or die; but I've already explained this...",o="Mataus, o Arauto da Ira, que está na Capela Esperança da Luz (nas Terras Pestilentas Orientais), fará Perneiras do Coração Pestilento se você levar para ele: 1 unidade de Perneiras Profanadas, 20 Restos de Tecido, 4 Lunatramas e 2 Cristais do Nexus.",oEN="Mataus the Wrathcaster at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make Plagueheart Leggings if you bring him the following: 1 Desecrated Leggings, 20 Wartorn Cloth Scraps, 4 Mooncloth and 2 Nexus Crystals.",c="Excelente, $n! Você trouxe tudo o que pedi. Agora posso confeccionar Calças de Coração Pestilento.",cEN="Exellent <name>!\\n, you got everything just as i asked and now i can make a Plagueheart Leggings."}
Q[209105]={d=false,dEN="I make no pretenses, maggot. The darkness Plagueheart items hold could very well destroy the both of us. That is why the price is so high. If I'm going to die, it's going to be as a rich man.\\n\\nAnd I don't give an ounce of gnoll spit how you die, only that you do as I ask. Bring me what I require and we will both benefit - or die; but I've already explained this...",o="Mataus, o Arauto da Ira, na Capela Esperança da Luz, que fica nas Terras Pestilentas Orientais, fará para você um Diadema do Coração Pestilento se você levar para ele: 1 Diadema Profanado, 15 Restos de Tecido, 3 pedaços de Lunatrama e 3 Cristais do Nexus.",oEN="Mataus the Wrathcaster at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make a Plagueheart Circlet if you bring him the following: 1 Desecrated Circlet, 15 Wartorn Cloth Scraps, 3 Mooncloth and 3 Nexus Crystals.",c="Excelente, $n! Você trouxe tudo o que pedi. Agora posso confeccionar Diadema de Coração Pestilento.",cEN="Exellent <name>!\\n, you got everything just as i asked and now i can make a Plagueheart Circlet."}
Q[209106]={d=false,dEN="I make no pretenses, maggot. The darkness Plagueheart items hold could very well destroy the both of us. That is why the price is so high. If I'm going to die, it's going to be as a rich man.\\n\\nAnd I don't give an ounce of gnoll spit how you die, only that you do as I ask. Bring me what I require and we will both benefit - or die; but I've already explained this...",o="Mataus, o Arauto da Ira, na Capela Esperança da Luz, que fica nas Terras Pestilentas Orientais, fará para você Ombreiras do Coração Pestilento se você levar para ele: 1 par de Ombreiras Profanadas, 12 Restos de Tecido, 2 pedaços de Lunatrama e 3 Pelegos Rústicos Curados.",oEN="Mataus the Wrathcaster at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make Plagueheart Shoulderpads if you bring him the following: 1 Desecrated Shoulderpads, 12 Wartorn Cloth Scraps, 2 Mooncloth and 3 Cured Rugged Hides.",c="Excelente, $n! Você trouxe tudo o que pedi. Agora posso confeccionar Ombreiras de Coração Pestilento.",cEN="Exellent <name>!\\n, you got everything just as i asked and now i can make a Plagueheart Shoulderpads."}
