Q[557011]={d=false,dEN="Attention, skilled woodcutters and craftsmen!\\n\\nThe artisans and builders of Azeroth are seeking a steady supply of quality timber for their crafts and construction projects. Journey to the nearby forests and wield your trusty axe to fell sturdy trees suitable for timber. Take the materials to a lumbermill and transform your raw lumber into refined planks.\\nEvery plank counts, so gather your tools and begin your journey as a true craftsman of Azeroth!",o="Colete 20 Tábuas de Madeira Verde",oEN="Collect 20 Green Wood Plank",p="Sua tarefa ainda não está concluída. Volte ao quadro quando tiver cumprido o contrato.",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
