Q[1005154]={d=false,dEN="Attention Heroes!\\n\\nWe need your help filling out a supply order the leatherworker's guild recently put in. Our skinners have been stopped and harassed while working by animal rights activists, it is looking like we aren't going to be able to meet any of our orders until this all blows over. That is where you come in though, Hero...Protest or not, we have orders to fill, and I am sure they wouldn't dare to stop you. Our leatherworkers need 2 Light Hides. Naturally, you will be handsomely rewarded for your assistance, hero.",o="Colete 5 Cueros ligeros.",oEN="Collect 5 Light Hides.",p="Sua tarefa ainda não está concluída. Volte ao quadro quando tiver cumprido o contrato.",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
