Q[1007453]={d=false,dEN="Animal rights groups are \\\\\\\"concerned\\\\\\\" with how we acquire our pelts...\\n\\nWe need your help heroes. It may be menial work, animal rights groups are harassing us about how we acquire our pelts, but that isn't important right now. What's important is that I need you to collect some pelts for me!\\n\\nCollect 1 Leatherworker's Satchel. Naturally, you will be handsomely rewarded for your assistance, hero.",o="Colete 1 Bolso de curtidor",oEN="Collect 1 Leatherworker's Satchel",p="Sua tarefa ainda não está concluída. Volte ao quadro quando tiver cumprido o contrato.",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[1007454]={d="Parece o que nos temos quidadeo sem plantas para nossa última mistura...\\nPrecisamos sua ajuda, heróis. Pode o que seja um trabalho rotineiro, mas se nos têm acabado as plantas para nossa última mistura Hacemos mezclas de plantas naturais com absolutamente nenhum sabor coloquei! No entanto, nossa última mistura de plantas parece estar agotándose rápido e estamos quedándonos sem suprimentos para fazer mais de ela Achao que poderia hacernos um favor?\\nColete 5 Poção do alquimista louco. E clareira, será generosamente recompensado por sua ajuda, herói.",dEN="Seems we are out of herbs for our latest blend...\\n\\nWe need your help heroes. It may be menial work, but we ran out of herbs for our latest blend! We make all natural herb blends with absolutely no added flavors! However, our latest herb blend seems to be selling out fast, and we are running out of supplies to make more of it! Do you think you could do us a favor?\\n\\nCollect 5 Mad Alchemist's Potion. Naturally, you will be handsomely rewarded for your assistance, hero.",o="Colete 5 Poção do alquimista louco",oEN="Collect 5 Mad Alchemist's Potion",p="Sua tarefa ainda não está concluída. Volte ao quadro quando tiver cumprido o contrato.",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[1007455]={d=false,dEN="Animal rights groups are \\\\\\\"concerned\\\\\\\" with how we acquire our pelts...\\n\\nWe need your help heroes. It may be menial work, animal rights groups are harassing us about how we acquire our pelts, but that isn't important right now. What's important is that I need you to collect some pelts for me!\\n\\nCollect 2 Heavy Knothide Armor Kit. Naturally, you will be handsomely rewarded for your assistance, hero.",o="Colete 2 Equipamento pesado de couro nodoso",oEN="Collect 2 Heavy Knothide Armor Kit",p="Sua tarefa ainda não está concluída. Volte ao quadro quando tiver cumprido o contrato.",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[1007457]={d=false,dEN="Animal rights groups are \\\\\\\"concerned\\\\\\\" with how we acquire our pelts...\\n\\nWe need your help heroes. It may be menial work, animal rights groups are harassing us about how we acquire our pelts, but that isn't important right now. What's important is that I need you to collect some pelts for me!\\n\\nCollect 2 Glove Reinforcements. Naturally, you will be handsomely rewarded for your assistance, hero.",o="Colete 2 Reforços para guante",oEN="Collect 2 Glove Reinforcements",p="Sua tarefa ainda não está concluída. Volte ao quadro quando tiver cumprido o contrato.",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[1007458]={d="Pensa... Pensa... Ataque cerebral!\\nPrecisamos sua ajuda, heróis. Poderia ser um trabalho rotineiro, mas temos tido uma ideia para uma máquinao que pode lavar o cérebro a pessoas Imagine os efeitos o que isto poderia ter em criminales e prisões! Em minha experiência, sempre é melhor avaliar o valor de algo superficialmente sem examinar demais as posibles consecuencias...\\nColete 2 Roubo de reparação do campo 110G. E clareira, será generosamente recompensado por sua ajuda, herói.",dEN="Think.... Think...! Brain Blast!\\n\\nWe need your help heroes. It may be menial work, but we came up with an idea for a contraption that can brainwash people! Imagine the effects this could have on criminals and incarceration! In my experience, it's always best to evaluate the value of something on a surface level without looking too much into the potential consequences...\\n\\nCollect 2 Field Repair Bot 110G. Naturally, you will be handsomely rewarded for your assistance, hero.",o="Colete 2 Roubo de reparação em campo 110G",oEN="Collect 2 Field Repair Bot 110G",p="Sua tarefa ainda não está concluída. Volte ao quadro quando tiver cumprido o contrato.",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
Q[1007459]={d=false,dEN="Animal rights groups are \\\\\\\"concerned\\\\\\\" with how we acquire our pelts...\\n\\nWe need your help heroes. It may be menial work, animal rights groups are harassing us about how we acquire our pelts, but that isn't important right now. What's important is that I need you to collect some pelts for me!\\n\\nCollect 1 Knothide Ammo Pouch. Naturally, you will be handsomely rewarded for your assistance, hero.",o="Colete 1 Guantelete de couro nodoso",oEN="Collect 1 Knothide Ammo Pouch",p="Sua tarefa ainda não está concluída. Volte ao quadro quando tiver cumprido o contrato.",pEN="Your task is not yet complete. Return to the board when you have fulfilled the contract."}
