Q[1100049]={d=false,dEN="Greetings <name>, during my years of training <class>s and exploring Azeroth, I've uncovered ancient scrolls detailing forgotten techniques - Mystic Enchantments that can enhance your natural abilities. These Mystic Scrolls are scattered across Azeroth, waiting to be found by worthy adventurers. Once you've acquired a scroll, you can harness its power.\\n\\nThese Rare Mystic Enchantments will refine your spells beyond standard training. They complement your existing abilities, providing subtle yet powerful advantages. As you grow in power, you'll discover more potent scrolls that unlock Epic and Legendary enchantments. But mastering these enchantments are the first step on that journey.\\n\\nYou may apply up to six of these enchantments to your arsenal. Each one you choose will shape how you develop as a <class>.",o="Escolha um Pergaminho Místico.",oEN="Pick a Mystic Scroll.",c="Você já ouviu falar dos Encantamentos Místicos? Esses poderes podem fortalecer muito você e suas habilidades. Para desbloqueá-los, será necessário encontrar Pergaminhos Místicos espalhados pelo mundo. Depois de obter um pergaminho, você poderá usar seu poder em um Altar de Encantamento Místico.\\n\\nConsegui reunir três desses pergaminhos. Você pode escolher um deles para ajudar em sua jornada.",cEN="Have you heard of Mystic Enchantments? These mystic powers can greatly enhance you and your abilities. To unlock them, you'll need to find Mystic Scrolls scattered across the world. Once you’ve acquired a scroll, you can harness its power at a Mystic Enchanting Altar.\\n\\nI’ve managed to collect three of these scrolls. You may choose one to aid you on your journey."}
